### Feature ServiceOrderItems — CREATE (SIN AUTH)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Agregar línea por unidad a una orden → 201 (recalcula totales)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service_order_id": 1,
  "laundry_service_id": 6,
  "quantity": 12
}

### Agregar línea por kg → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service_order_id": 1,
  "laundry_service_id": 2,
  "quantity": 8,
  "weight_kg": 4.2
}
